	<text id="intro1">There are many problems in our space.</text>
	<text id="intro2">It is teeming with alien parasites, debris, and asteroids, making space navigation extremely challenging.</text>
	<text id="intro3">Therefore, the Star Federation sends Utilizers into deep space to make it safer for interstellar travel.</text>
	<text id="intro4">Welcome to the Utilization Service, pilot!</text>

	<text id="utilService">Utilization Service</text>
	<text id="utilServiceSlogan">making space safe since {YEAR}</text>

	<text id="begin1">Start with the space sectors of the star cluster "Celestia". There aren't many dangers here, so I think you can handle it.</text>
	<text id="begin2">Your main goal is to collect waste containers on the utilization platform.</text>
	<text id="begin3">And don't forget to sort the waste by color. Remember: we don't need mixed waste, and you won't get a reward for it!</text>
	<text id="begin4">Eliminate alien parasites. You will receive a reward for each one eliminated, depending on its size and danger level, of course.</text>
	<text id="begin4_2">Get rid of the remaining monsters to complete the sector.</text>
	<text id="begin5">You will also be rewarded for completing the sector cleanup. Finish the sector with 3 skill stars and get a big reward!</text>

	<text id="upgradeThis">Upgrade your ship: modernize the utilization platform, buy powerful guns, upgrade your engines, and get nuclear charges!</text>
	<text id="styleThis">If you want to look cool, you can also visit the styling store and purchase holographic stickers for your ship.</text>

	<text id="nextCluster">Well, you've proven yourself to be an experienced pilot, and now we can give you missions in more dangerous sectors. Your reward will increase, naturally!</text>

	<text id="MioriaCluster">The "Mioria" cluster is known for its vast asteroid fields and frequent invasions of dangerous alien parasites. Stay vigilant!</text>
	<text id="IkarCluster">The "Ikarus" cluster contains a high concentration of space debris, requiring special attention and effort for its utilization. Be careful and avoid collisions!</text>
	<text id="AlderraCluster">The "Alderra" cluster often encounters huge swarms of alien monsters threatening our trade routes. Be careful, pilot, and keep your weapons ready!</text>
	<text id="TalimanCluster">The "Taliman" cluster consists of many complex sectors where Utilizers can earn big rewards for cleanup. But remember the mortal danger and don't act recklessly!</text>
	<text id="ErgoCluster">The "Ergo" cluster is known for its mysterious and dangerous sectors, where even the most experienced pilots can encounter unexpected threats. Be prepared for any "surprises"!</text>
	<text id="HortusCluster">The "Hortus" cluster is the most dangerous in our galaxy. Only the best ships with enhanced defenses can clear it. Be prepared before venturing there!</text>

	<text id="boss1Desc">Wow, looks like this One-Eye is bigger than the rest!</text>
	<text id="boss2Desc">Be careful, this Armorhead has a powerful laser!</text>
	<text id="boss3Desc">Hmm, who is this - Cosmochick? Beware of its plasma tail!</text>
	<text id="boss4Desc">Oh no, it's a Firespitter, run for your life!</text>
	<text id="boss5Desc">Oh, and this is a Multiplier. If you're not careful, it will fill the entire sector with one-eyes!</text>
	<text id="boss6Desc">Well, well, who is this, Evilhelm? I've never seen one so huge!</text>
	<text id="boss7Desc">Oh no, it's a giant Bombtacle! Dodge its bombs and force field!</text>

	<text id="asterMode">There are no monsters in this sector, but there are extremely many asteroids and debris, so a general cleanup is required here!</text>
	<text id="invMode">In this sector, alien parasites gather in huge swarms and attack our trade ships. Defend our space from the monster invasion!</text>
	<text id="survMode">Test your skills in "Survival" mode: clearing endless space routes of alien pests. Every parsec of clean space will be paid for!</text>
	<text id="abyssMode">Congratulations,you have discovered the Great Abyss! This is an extremely dangerous place, and no one knows what you might encounter there. Only the bravest and most prepared pilots dare to fly there, good luck!</text>

